    {
      "id": "frag-4",
      "focal_uid": 4,
      "title": "Where the trouble starts",
      "insight": "Middle-East and US\u2013Iran tension is a true root cause \u2014 nothing feeds into it, but it feeds almost everything else: reserve releases, the dollar, trader positioning, and the price directly. When this lights up it sets off several chains at once, which is why a single flare-up can move the forecast so much.",
      "role": "source",
