    {
      "id": "frag-3",
      "focal_uid": 3,
      "title": "The barrels that fill the gap",
      "insight": "Russian and other non-OPEC oil is the swing that offsets \u2014 or amplifies \u2014 OPEC and geopolitics. Conflict and OPEC decisions push on it, and it lands on both the price and the world's storage tanks. This is the 'who actually ships the oil' part of the story once the politics are set.",
